<view class="page">
  <view class="brand"><image src="/assets/shiji-ai-avatar.png" mode="aspectFill"/><view><view class="brand-title">AI 记餐</view><view class="brand-subtitle">描述吃过的食物，或记录今天的运动</view></view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="eyebrow">使用提示</view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:12rpx">任何数据写入都会先展示确认卡片。运动消耗和营养数值均为日常记录参考。</view></view>
  <scroll-view scroll-y class="thread">
    <view wx:if="{{messages.length === 0}}" class="empty">试试：我吃了鸡胸肉100克<br/>或：今天打了60分钟网球</view>
    <view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="id" class="bubble {{item.role}}">
      <text>{{item.text}}</text>
      <view wx:if="{{item.response && item.response.basisText}}" class="list-sub">{{item.response.basisText}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.response && item.response.action}}" class="action-card">
        <view class="action-summary">{{item.response.action.summary}}</view>
        <view class="muted" style="margin-top:10rpx">{{item.response.action.status === 'proposed' ? '确认后才会写入记录' : item.response.action.status === 'confirmed' ? '已确认并写入记录' : '已取消，未写入数据'}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.response.action.status === 'proposed'}}" class="button-row" style="margin-top:16rpx"><button class="button secondary" bindtap="cancelAction" data-id="{{item.response.action.id}}" data-revision="{{item.response.action.revision}}">取消</button><button class="button" bindtap="confirmAction" data-id="{{item.response.action.id}}" data-revision="{{item.response.action.revision}}">确认记录</button></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="composer"><textarea value="{{input}}" maxlength="500" auto-height placeholder="例如：今天打了60分钟网球" bindinput="onInput" bindconfirm="send" confirm-type="send"/><button class="button" loading="{{sending}}" disabled="{{sending || !input}}" bindtap="send">发送</button></view>
  <view class="disclaimer">本结果仅供日常饮食健康参考，不构成医疗诊断或治疗建议。\n如出现持续或严重不适，请及时咨询医生或注册营养师。</view>
</view>
